er entertainment events and activities. The company was formerly known as New Canterbury Park Holding Corporation and changed its name to Canterbury Park Holding Corporation in June 2016. Canterbury Park Holding Corporation was incorporated in 1994 and is based in Shakopee, Minnesota."}}